input_prompt: Explain what on-device AI means in simple terms.


On-device AI is like having a smart computer in your pocket! It means that the AI (a machine learning system) runs directly on your device, like a phone or smart home device, instead of sending all your data to the cloud (a big server on the internet).  

For example, when you take a photo with your phone, the AI on the device can instantly recognize faces, objects, or text, all in real time. This makes it faster and more secure because your data doesn’t leave your device. It’s like having a tiny supercomputer that helps you do tasks right where you are, without needing to connect to the internet

